  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract stemming from Call for Proposals INTPA/2021/EA-RP/0003. JOINT TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE FOR THE LATIN AMERICA INVESTMENT FACILITY (LAIF) AND THE CARIBBEAN INVESTMENT FACILITY (CIF). This contract is to provide TA for monitoring, communication and programme management support. It feds from two different decisions, EUR1M from this one (41884) and the rest, EUR 1,461,325, from a LAIF decision (35750)</narrative>
